  "description": "The romance between the heroine who must die to go back and the hero who returns to stop her death Hero Arcane and Dana who is fated to die for heroine Stella. She must most faithfully live and die in order to go back to her own reality. But, why would the hero be so obsessed with me?! Also, is it just me or is it actually going way off the track...?! \"I will never let you die because of me again, Dana!\" \n\n(Source: Lezhin)",
